        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move (N/S/E/W) costs 1 stamina; when stamina reaches 0 you lose 1 life and stamina resets to max, and losing all lives ends the game. Movement is blocked by walls; the state provides a blocked_directions list and attempting those directions should be avoided. Special modifier tiles change the carried piece: shape modifiers cycle shapes 0\u20135 (wrapping), color modifiers cycle orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange, and rotation modifiers rotate 90\u00b0 clockwise (0\u219290\u2192180\u2192270\u21920). A goal becomes activated only when shape+color+rotation all match; then stepping onto the goal tile completes it. Some tiles may also refill stamina."
